    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-source-traceability> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-source-traceability-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py L115–L147" ;
        dcterms:description "Runtime SHA-256 verification of the reference JSON and the specimen micrograph" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py#L115-L147> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-source-traceability-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/pleural_cavity_valve_reference.json L1–L85" ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 3 reference table with per-constant provenance flags (literature vs model) and doi_verified_offline: false on the 4 new citations" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/pleural_cavity_valve_reference.json#L1-L85> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-source-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Nelson et al. (2017) Development & Kim et al. (2015) Dev. Cell microfluidic transmural pressure, Laplace epithelial wall stress, ASM peristalsis, 3D ellipsoidal pleural cavity tree, Poiseuille/CFTR luminal pressure network and laryngeal valve cycles driving embryonic lung branching — Source and data traceability: 89/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-20"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "`datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/` now carries 9 BibTeX entries (`paper_citations.bib` L1-104), the SHA-256-pinned specimen and reference JSON verified at runtime (`verify_dataset_integrity`, L115-147), and the new `pleural_cavity_valve_reference.json` (85 lines) which flags every Pass 3 constant as `provenance: literature` or `provenance: model` and records `doi_verified_offline: false` for the four new citations. Deductions: the four new DOIs (Olver & Strang 1974, Harding et al. 1986, Harding & Hooper 1996, Metzger et al. 2008) were recorded from memory and could not be verified offline in this pass (bib `note` fields L56, L68, L80, L92) (-4); McCray et al. 1992 is cited in a code comment (L381) with no bib entry (-1); the cavity geometry (`CAVITY_SEMI_AXES`, `CAVITY_CENTER`, `CHEST_LENGTH_SCALE_UM`, L389-391) and the secretion magnitudes (`J_CL_*`, L393-394) are unsourced model choices, and `P_CLOSED_GLOTTIS_PLATEAU_PA` = 250 Pa was chosen inside the Harding & Hooper 1-2 mmHg range to coincide with the Pass 2 JSON's 250 Pa occlusion regime (-3); the `*_obs` sweep columns carry no figure/table digitisation provenance (Pass 2 carry-over) (-2); the campaign-level seed paper (Nelson 2015, 10.1242/dev.119123, Gallus gallus) does not match the modelled sources (-1)." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-source-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/source-traceability" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py L378–L381: McCray et al. 1992 cited in a comment without a corresponding bib entry <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py#L378-L381>",
            "2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py L389–L399: Cavity semi-axes, chest scale, J_Cl magnitudes, closed-glottis plateau, R_open/R_closed, FBM period and tau_closed: model choices, only partially literature-ranged <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/2015-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering.py#L389-L399>",
            "datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/paper_citations.bib L47–L92: olver1974, harding1986, harding1996, metzger2008 entries, each with note 'DOI not verified offline (Pass 3)' <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/171769b9/datasets/tracheal_viscous_fingering/paper_citations.bib#L47-L92>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-source-traceability-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-sugimura-tracheal-viscous-fingering-source-traceability-2> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.89"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

